        <h2 id="subject-ideas">4. Subject-Specific Activity Ideas</h2>
        <p>
          The wheel earns its place by being genuinely useful across subjects
          rather than a one-trick tool. Here's a starting point, plus eight
          worked examples:
        </p>

        <div class="subject-band">
          <div class="subject-card sc-math">
            <div class="sc-icon">➕</div>
            <div class="sc-label">Mathematics</div>
            <div class="sc-ideas">
